    "DisplayTitle": "Terminate UEE Threat: [TargetName]",
    "Description": "MISSION SPECS\n\nArea of Operation: ~mission(Location|Address)\nHostile Forces: Outlaws\nEquipment Specs: Heavy Gun-Ship\nBriefing: An outlaw fleet lead by <EM4>~mission(TargetName)</EM4> has been planning a major strike against vital UEE infrastructure. InterSec has been tasked with dealing with this threat before their attack can be launched.\n\nGather a suitable amount of support craft and head to the engagement site. There you will have to engage with various squadrons before their leader will deem the situation dire enough to directly lead their forces. It is critical that they be neutralized in order to ensure the attack is stopped.\n\nRespectfully, \n\nDeacon Tobin \nOperations Manager \nInterSec Defense Solutions  \n\nThis communication consists of a non-binding offer that upon acceptance may be immediately terminated by either party without any given notice. All operations are conducted at the contractor\u2019s own personal risk and must adhere to system law where applicable.",
